    "body": "Relay BB run pushed an update.\n\nPull request: #327\n\nTokens: 0 · Cost: $0.0000\n\nPushed successfully to branch `bb/relay-121-agent-runtime-08-08-report-ai-utilizat-thr_52evi3pabp`.\n\nThis push adds one new commit (`3921113`) on top of the existing PR #327 branch, addressing all open code-review findings:\n\n- **Fixed the client-side secret leak (HIGH)**: `VITE_SEMPREC_API_TOKEN` is no longer read or referenced anywhere in browser-reachable code. The bearer token is now attached server-side only, via the Vite dev proxy reading a non-`VITE_`-prefixed, Node-only env var — it never enters the client bundle.\n- **Fixed the swallowed unexpected error (HIGH)**: `aiUsageHandler.ts` now logs unexpected (non-`ChokePointError`) failures with `console.error` before returning a 500, instead of discarding them silently.\n- **Fixed the timing-unsafe token comparison (MEDIUM)**: bearer token comparison now uses `crypto.timingSafeEqual` with a length check instead of `===`.\n\nAdded test coverage for the length-mismatch short-circuit and the unexpected-error/500-logging path. Full verification passed: backend and web typechecks, backend unit/integration/e2e suites (497+83+5 tests), full web test suite (86 tests), and `check:boundaries` — all clean.\n\nRelay-Step-Status: pass",
