    "body": "Relay BB run pushed an update.\n\nPull request: #327\n\nTokens: 0 · Cost: $0.0000\n\nPushed successfully to branch `bb/relay-121-agent-runtime-08-08-report-ai-utilizat-thr_52evi3pabp`.\n\nThis push adds commit `54f5f58` addressing the latest review round on PR #327:\n\n- **Unmet acceptance criterion #9**: Added a graphical Utilization chart for token usage. `getAiUsageReport` now returns a `dailyTokenUsage` series (input/output tokens per calendar day, mirroring the existing daily cost series), and the System page renders it as a stacked-bar chart alongside the existing cost-per-day chart.\n- **Medium finding (test coverage)**: `UtilizationPage`'s retry test now actually clicks the retry button and asserts the second call recovers, rather than only checking that the error state appears.\n- **Low finding**: `serve.ts` now validates `PORT` at startup and throws a clear error for a non-numeric or non-positive value, instead of silently binding to a random ephemeral port via `NaN`.\n\nFull verification passed: backend and web typechecks clean, web production build clean with no secret leakage into the bundle, full web test suite (86 tests), backend unit (83) and e2e (5) suites, and `check:boundaries` — all clean. Backend integration tests passed 497/498, with the single failure being a pre-existing flaky concurrency test unrelated to this issue (confirmed reliably passing in isolation); the new/updated `aiUsageReport` tests all passed.\n\nRelay-Step-Status: pass",
